            "columns": null,
            "questionDiagrams": [],
            "children": [],
            "answer": {
              "short": "$y=4(x+1)^2-1$. Concave up; vertex $(-1,-1)$; axis $x=-1$; $y$-intercept $(0,3)$; $x$-intercepts $\\left(-\\frac32,0\\right)$ and $\\left(-\\frac12,0\\right)$.",
              "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}y&=4\\left(x^2+2x+\\frac34\\right)\\\\y&=4\\left(x^2+2x+1-1+\\frac34\\right)\\\\y&=4\\left((x+1)^2-\\frac14\\right)\\\\y&=4(x+1)^2-1\\end{aligned}$$\nSince $4>0$, the parabola is concave up. The vertex is $(-1,-1)$ and the axis is $x=-1$.\n\nLet $x=0$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}y&=4(0+1)^2-1\\\\y&=3\\end{aligned}$$\nThe $y$-intercept is $(0,3)$.\n\nLet $y=0$:\n$$\\begin{aligned}4(x+1)^2-1&=0\\\\(x+1)^2&=\\frac14\\\\x+1&=\\pm\\frac12\\\\x&=-1\\pm\\frac12\\\\x&=-\\frac32\\text{ or }-\\frac12\\end{aligned}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": [
                {
                  "id": "p33-q4-b-graph",
                  "role": "solution",
                  "format": "tikz",
                  "code": "% mathsmap-diagram-colours {\"version\":1,\"kind\":\"graph\",\"base\":[],\"semantic\":[],\"reference\":\"source page 33 p33-q4-b-graph\"}\n\\begin{tikzpicture}[x=14mm,y=5mm]\n\\special{dvisvgm:raw <metadata data-graph-strokes=\"1\"/>}\n\\draw[<->,line width=0.5pt] (-2.8,0)--(1.2,0) node[right] {$x$};\n\\draw[<->,line width=0.5pt] (0,-4)--(0,6) node[above] {$y$};\n\\draw[<->,line width=0.8pt,domain=-2.25:0.25,samples=81] plot (\\x,{4*(\\x+1)^2-1});\n\\coordinate (mmPoint21) at (-1.5,0);\n\\node[name=mmLabel21,below left,xshift=-6mm,yshift=-12mm] at (-1.5,0) {$-\\frac32$};\n\\draw[housegrid,dashed,line width=0.25pt] (mmPoint21)--(mmPoint21 |- mmLabel21.north east)--(mmLabel21.north east);\n\\coordinate (mmPoint22) at (-0.5,0);\n\\node[name=mmLabel22,below right,xshift=6mm,yshift=-12mm] at (-0.5,0) {$-\\frac12$};\n\\draw[housegrid,dashed,line width=0.25pt] (mmPoint22)--(mmPoint22 |- mmLabel22.north west)--(mmLabel22.north west);\n\\node[right] at (0,3) {$3$};\n\\coordinate (mmPoint9) at (-1,-1);\n\\node[name=mmLabel9,below,yshift=-1mm] at (-1,-1) {$(-1,-1)$};\n\\end{tikzpicture}",
